            <td>Schedule / window / no-trigger need &ge;1 skill; event-turn may have none</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Limits</td><td>None</td>
            <td>Max 5 skills, 32&nbsp;KB compiled, measured in UTF-8 bytes</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Editing</td><td>Prompt loaded into the editor</td>
            <td>Frozen text shown read-only, resent untouched unless skills are chosen</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Empty library</td><td>&mdash;</td>
            <td>Link to the agent&rsquo;s skills page instead of a disabled button</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table></div>
